---
import { SITE } from "@/config.ts";
---

<main id="main-content" class="app-layout academic-home" lang="en">
  <section class="intro-heading" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CORNER OF THE INTERNET</p>
    <h1 id="home-title">Hey, I'm <span>bx.</span></h1>
    <p class="welcome">Welcome to my blog!</p>
  </section>

  <div class="home-grid">
    <div class="intro-body">
      <p class="intro-focus">
        I'm currently focused on <strong>Cybersecurity and Large Language Models (LLMs)</strong>, while staying curious about interesting technologies and the unknown.
      </p>
      <div class="intro-prose">
        <p>This is my little corner of the internet where I document what I learn, explore, and think about. Most of the content revolves around technology, including study notes, hands-on experiences, and scattered thoughts. Occasionally, I'll also share things beyond the world of tech.</p>
        <p>I don't expect every post to have all the answers. More often than not, what I write simply reflects my understanding at a particular point in time. As I continue to explore and learn, my perspectives may shift, my understanding will evolve, and I'll revisit, refine, and update what I've written along the way.</p>
        <p>I hope this blog becomes a space where ideas and experiences gradually accumulate, leaving traces of my explorations and capturing my growth along the journey.</p>
        <p>Feel free to look around! If something here helps you, sparks a thought, or gives you a different perspective, I'd love to hear from you.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="closing"><strong>Let's explore the stars and beyond together. <span class="closing-star">🌟</span></strong></p>
      <nav class="home-links" aria-label="Explore the blog">
        <a class="read-link" href="/blog/">Read the blog <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a href="/notes/">Notes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a href={SITE.profile} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <aside class="home-sidebar">
      <div class="star-map" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 280 180" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <circle class="orbit" cx="140" cy="90" r="72" />
          <circle class="orbit" cx="140" cy="90" r="48" />
          <path class="constellation" d="M51 113L99 71L148 96L191 44L228 75" />
          <g class="star-points"><circle cx="51" cy="113" r="3"/><circle cx="99" cy="71" r="3.5"/><circle cx="148" cy="96" r="3"/><circle cx="228" cy="75" r="3"/><circle cx="66" cy="36" r="1.5"/><circle cx="209" cy="133" r="1.5"/><circle cx="124" cy="146" r="1.5"/></g>
          <path class="north-star" d="M191 33L193.5 41.5L202 44L193.5 46.5L191 55L188.5 46.5L180 44L188.5 41.5Z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <section class="education-section" aria-labelledby="education-title">
        <h2 id="education-title">Education</h2>
        <ul class="education-list">
          <li>
            <img src="/schools/hainan-university-emblem.webp" width="40" height="40" alt="" loading="lazy" />
            <div><span class="school-abbr">HNU</span><h3>Hainan University</h3><p>Bachelor's studies in Information Security</p></div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <img src="/schools/ucas-emblem.webp" width="40" height="40" alt="" loading="lazy" />
            <div><span class="school-abbr">UCAS</span><h3>University of Chinese Academy of Sciences</h3><p>Master's studies</p></div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>
</main>

<style>
  .academic-home { --home-muted: #59616b; --home-rule: color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 16%, transparent); padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem); }
  :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .academic-home { --home-muted: #aab5c3; }
  .intro-heading { padding-bottom: 2.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-rule); }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: var(--home-muted); font-family: var(--font-cartograph), monospace; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .1em; line-height: 1.8; }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem); line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  h1 span { color: var(--accent); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .welcome { margin: .85rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.35rem); line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.015em; }
  .home-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 15rem; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); padding-top: 2.5rem; }
  .intro-body { min-width: 0; }
  .intro-focus { margin: 0 0 1.75rem; font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.85; letter-spacing: -.012em; }
  .intro-focus strong { font-weight: 650; }
  .intro-prose { font-family: var(--font-sans); color: var(--home-muted); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: .002em; }
  .intro-prose p { margin: 0 0 1.35rem; }
  .closing { margin: 2rem 0 0; padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 2px solid var(--accent); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .closing strong { font-weight: 550; }
  .closing-star { display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap; }
  .home-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 1rem 1.6rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .home-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; color: var(--accent); font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .home-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .home-links .read-link { padding: .7rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--accent); border-radius: .35rem; background: var(--accent); color: var(--background); gap: 1.4rem; }
  .home-links .read-link:hover { text-decoration: none; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 88%, var(--foreground)); }
  .home-links a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 5px; }
  .home-sidebar { min-width: 0; border-left: 1px solid var(--home-rule); padding-left: 1.75rem; }
  .star-map { padding: .2rem 0 1.5rem; color: var(--accent); }
  .star-map svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .orbit { stroke: var(--home-rule); stroke-dasharray: 2 6; }
  .constellation { stroke: currentColor; stroke-opacity: .45; stroke-width: 1; }
  .star-points, .north-star { fill: currentColor; }
  .education-section { padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--home-rule); }
  .education-section h2 { margin: 0 0 1.75rem; font-size: .7rem; line-height: 1.5; font-family: var(--font-cartograph), monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; font-weight: 600; color: var(--home-muted); }
  .education-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .education-list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2.5rem minmax(0, 1fr); gap: .8rem; align-items: start; }
  .education-list li + li { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .education-list img { width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; object-fit: contain; }
  .school-abbr { display: block; margin-bottom: .3rem; font-family: var(--font-cartograph), monospace; color: var(--accent); font-size: .66rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .education-list h3 { margin: 0; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.55; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .education-list p { margin: .5rem 0 0; color: var(--home-muted); font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .home-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.75rem; }
    .home-sidebar { padding: 0; border-left: 0; }
    .star-map { display: none; }
    .education-section { padding-top: 1.75rem; }
    .education-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .education-list li + li { margin-top: 0; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .academic-home { padding-top: 2rem; }
    .intro-heading { padding-bottom: 1.75rem; }
    .eyebrow { font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .09em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .home-grid { padding-top: 1.75rem; }
    .intro-focus { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; }
    .intro-prose { font-size: .94rem; line-height: 1.85; }
    .closing { font-size: .95rem; }
    .education-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.75rem; }
  }
</style>
